[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240482934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110123#issuecomment-3240482934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110123","id":3240482934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BJdh2","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-31T23:16:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T23:16:17Z","body":"You can get the stylebox and tween it's properties directly.\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar tween = get_tree().create_tween().set_parallel(true)\n\tvar style = get_theme_stylebox(&\"normal\", &\"Button\")\n\ttween.tween_property(style, \"content_margin_left\", 16.0, 2)\n\ttween.tween_property(style, \"content_margin_right\", 16.0, 2)\n\ttween.tween_property(style, \"content_margin_top\", 16.0, 2)\n\ttween.tween_property(style, \"content_margin_bottom\", 16.0, 2)\n```\n\nAlso the styleboxes are shared with many other nodes, which means changing any of them will emit `changed` signal to update all the Nodes using the same style, so it's better to override the stylebox first and to not tween the default shared ones.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240482934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242875429","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110123#issuecomment-3242875429","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110123","id":3242875429,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BSlol","user":{"login":"jermjar","id":98186820,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdo2RA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98186820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar","html_url":"https://github.com/jermjar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jermjar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T16:27:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T16:43:44Z","body":"Thanks for the response WhalesState!  Yes, I'm aware of the method you showed above and the problems that come with it.  That is why in my example above and in the MRP, I _thought_ I was trying to override the stylebox and not tween the default, but there is either a syntax error/bug in my implementation, or something wrong with the engine.\n\nI also noticed that I can't tween the content_margin_top or content_margin_bottom of focus, even with the method above","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242875429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677300652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110123#issuecomment-3677300652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110123","id":3677300652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bLyes","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T02:54:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T02:56:32Z","body":"To tween the override properties, you will need to add a StyleBox override (if there isn't already one) with `add_theme_stylebox_override`, and it can be gotten with the regular `get_theme_stylebox` since it returns the override if it exists. The `content_margin` properties can then be tweened on the StyleBox.\n\nAlso the Button `focus` StyleBox doesn't really use the content margins, it is just displayed on top of other ones.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677300652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]